n is back on the market at a reduced price]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134830040.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Dennis Quaid has lowered the price of his Los Angeles mansion from $5.2 million to $4.6 million. He relocated to Nashville with his wife, Laura Savoie, and considers it their primary residence. After buying the Brentwood Hills property for $3.9 million in 2017, Quaid undertook extensive renovations. He expressed dissatisfaction with Los Angeles due to rising taxes and local governance issues.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/dennis-quaid-bought-a-brentwood-hills-home-for-3-9-million-in-2017-and-extensively-remodeled-it-after-listing-for-5-2-million-in-may-2026-the-actor-has-cut-the-asking-price-to-4-6-million/articleshow/134830040.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/dennis-quaid-bought-a-brentwood-hills-home-for-3-9-million-in-2017-and-extensively-remodeled-it-after-listing-for-5-2-million-in-may-2026-the-actor-has-cut-the-asking-price-to-4-6-million/articleshow/134830040.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T15:58:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134830376,imgsize-292544.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Russell Peters lists his 1.3-acre Malibu estate for $8.5M after buying it for $4.725M]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134830449.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Renowned comedian Russell Peters is making headlines again as he lists his stunning Malibu estate for sale at $8.5 million. After acquiring the property in 2014 for $4.725 million, he has transformed it with substantial renovations. This luxurio